# What is published (GitHub Pages) is only what the game needs to RUN:
#   index.html, credits.txt, .nojekyll, src/, lib/, assets/ (the art the game loads + licence texts), music/ (tracks, TRACKLIST.txt, files.json)
# Everything below stays on the author's computer.

# --- the art packs exactly as downloaded, and art that is not used ---------------------------------------------------------------
# (several of these packs forbid redistributing them, and the Sidescroller's Dungeon download has no licence file.  The game only
#  uses the pieces cut out of them into assets/env/ and assets/sprites/ - see CREDITS.md.)
assets/sprites/source/
assets/source/
assets/archive/

# --- local play and development tools (not needed to play online) ------------------------------------------------------------
server.js
play.bat
play.ps1
tools/

# --- editor / assistant settings, and general clutter ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# lets the generator tests run under Node (the browser ignores it)
src/package.json
